# Design for the reader
@scenario office_lesson_15
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk notes]
pip: I can read the noticeboard from the back of the room. Give dialogue the same breathing space.
pip: Open config/ui/dialogue.layout and increase dialogueTextHorizontalPadding. Compare two window sizes.
@label check
pip: Which setting changes text inset inside the panel?
> dialogueTextHorizontalPadding -> correct
> characterBaselineY -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Padding changes the inner margin. Character framing is independent. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Padding changes the inner margin. Character framing is independent.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_15]
[flag tutorial_done_15]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
